INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(6513,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11064353','Intersectionality as a tool for clinical ethics consultation in mental healthcare.','Faissner M, Brünig L, Gaillard AS, Jieman AT, Gather J, Hempeler C.','2024','countering kimberle crenshaw interdependency sexism oppressive stereotyping microaggressions particularities henceforth endangerment declination carved authoritarian refrains authoritarian pronounces faissner cecs stereotyping angove ngui repenshek ostensibly precarious duly testimonial quieting smothering testimonial quieting unjustified downgrading crichton carel disbelieved incoherent testimonial smothering invalidation slim sporty refuses climbing stapled throws oblivious milliken characterizations milliken othering othering dangerousness deescalating stipulate campelia pertinence macduffie storytelling storytelling storytelling attentiveness invalidation storytelling storytelling metzl framings imagining confucian braodening marginalizing campelia oblivious problematically privileging campelia standpoints magelssen realms unpack euphemisms trivialized invalidated microaggressions derogatory smothering loudly overreliance reprimanded defensiveness complainant breakdowns problematically microaggressions testimonies deconstructing macduffie asymmetries marginalize renegotiating dichristina complain dichristina traumatization jieman goodwill subvert retaliation reevaluating gerald neitzke insist ruhr bochum bmbf insist 01gp2188 p000703 thames bmbf bmbf salus 01gp1792 footnote psychotherapists invalidated argumentative othering othering postcolonial microaggressions microlevel macduffie asbh asbh_code_of_ethics haslanger sociopolitical haslanger braddock crenshaw demarginalizing antidiscrimination chicagounbound uchicago uclf vol1989 iss1 crenshaw combahee combahee blackpast combahee definitional funer humanit s13010 hempeler windel carlet philipsen juckel crd42022284928 display_record crd42022284928 ogbu nwobodo apology apo